▛//▞▞ ⟦⎊⟧ :: ⧗-26.369 // TelePromptR :: the station ▞▞

telos: the Telegram relay's node entry. Identity lives here,
code does not. :: ∎

type    Station
port    7089
gen     CENTRAL.CMD/Telegram/TelePromptR/TPR.Gen/   ← the code
config  CENTRAL.CMD/Telegram/TelePromptR/           ← .station · ZenBots
hub     !7HE.BRIDGE/HUB/TelePromptR/                ← the corpus
seat    "tpr" in ~/.sysgen/registry/v1/seats.kdl
bot     Ender_ZenBot
webhook corbato-en0.billfish-sirius.ts.net/tpr/webhook

law
  NO code runs from Citadel. Citadel is storage.
  Code lives in TPR.Gen (the .Gen law: <Entity>.Gen/ is the
  polyglot runtime home). This station holds identity and
  version slots only — same split as Ender.Gen vs
  _TRON/Agents/Ender.

:: ∎
